Usage: fva init <directory> [--lib Name] [--wasm file.wasm]

Create a verification project: FVA vendored in fva/, a lakefile, and templates for the
spec and the proofs. With --wasm, also the artifact and its lifted module.

Options:
  --lib Name         The library name, a Lean module name (default Verified).
  --wasm file.wasm   Copy this artifact into the project and lift it.

Exit status: 0 when the project is written, 2 for a usage or setup error.
